{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Raiding_2025-04-1914-37-13-ezgif.com-optimize__1_z.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTENSE NAVAL BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are riches to claim and broadsides to dodge! Devise cunning plans to outmaneuver your enemies or be claimed by the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Inv_2025-04-1910-42-31-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Successful pirating requires the right tools! Equip your ship with different weapons, gadgets and mythical relics \u2014 as the captain you get to freely design the layout of your own ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Combat_2025-04-1915-16-17-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLUNDER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Barter with different factions or sink their ships for some precious loot. You might even get lucky and discover an ancient treasure map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Upgrade_2025-04-1913-14-05-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover, upgrade &amp; synergize! Pretty much everything can be upgraded, and through clever inventory management, you can unlock truly ingenious and terrifying combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Building_2025-04-1913-19-49-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PIRATE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own pirate hideout to stash loot and expand your influence across the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Axe_2025-04-2113-44-17-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER THE SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different ships, varying objectives and plenty of upgradable equipment \u2014 <i>Roguebound Pirates</i> is designed to be highly replayable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/Furl_2025-04-2209-46-38-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745408737\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is in active development. You can join <strong>Discord</strong> to share ideas &amp; follow devlogs on <strong>YouTube</strong>.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3327000?t=1745408737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3327000?t=1745408737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/195ec5526aa9ea619dadc233094e2db1080b96a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745408737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/195ec5526aa9ea619dadc233094e2db1080b96a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745408737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_